# Quail emits raw HTML snapshots of crawled pages under tests/e2e/_dom/
# for debugging the probe. They aren't referenced by any test and bloat
# PR diffs. Ignore them (the local probe still emits them; they just
# never get committed).
tests/e2e/_dom/

# Quail also snapshots stakeholder docs into tests/e2e/docs/history/
# (timestamped summary-*.html + findings-*.md) on every probe. The
# canonical tests/e2e/docs/summary.html + findings.md stay tracked;
# the timestamped history is local-only (quail serve still renders it
# from the filesystem).
tests/e2e/docs/history/
